---
// src/pages/about/index.astro
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About Us | RedGreen Studio" description="RedGreen Studio builds small, focused, privacy-first developer tools.">
  <section class="about">
    <h1>About RedGreen Studio</h1>
    <p>
      RedGreen Studio started as a small side project: a suite of fast, lightweight developer utilities we kept reaching for ourselves — including a JSON viewer & tree editor, side-by-side diff checker, Base64 encoder, JWT debugger, and custom QR generator.




    </p>
    <p>
      Every tool on RedGreen Studio is built offline-first and client-side. All calculations, string conversions, and data parsing run 100% locally within your browser using modern Web Workers. There are no mandatory account registrations, zero server-side data logging, and no risk of sensitive payloads, keys, or API logs ever leaving your device.
    </p>
    <p>
      We believe essential web utilities should be blazingly fast, free of bloat, and uncompromising on data privacy. Thanks for using RedGreen Studio — we're constantly shipping new tools, and feedback is always welcome!
    </p>
<p>
      <strong>Why Client-Side Matters</strong><br>

Every tool runs entirely within your browser using local execution logic. By keeping operations offline-first, your data stays strictly on your machine — ensuring ultra-fast execution times with maximum privacy compliance.

No logins, no tracking scripts, and no server roundtrips. Just clean, reliable utilities when you need them.
    </p>

  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }

  .about h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about p {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
